# Broodrage Mycoid's Fungus token has "This token can't block" (CR 509.1b): when Bot2's Memnite attacks on turn 4, Bot1 may not block it with the Fungus token, while the Mycoid itself (no such text) may and kills it.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Broodrage Mycoid
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Broodrage Mycoid.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Memnite > Bot1)
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Block(Fungus Token > Memnite)
Bot1.Block(Broodrage Mycoid > Memnite)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
Bot1.Battlefield.Broodrage Mycoid.Damage = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Fungus Token.Damage = 0
